%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('cleaner_called') && !HasFlag('clinic_cleaned')
goto: Working

cond: true
goto: Idle

%rec: Nodes
%type: npc multiline

name: Idle
npc: (A tired man in stained coveralls sits on his bed, phone in hand.)
+ Blood, puke, worse. You make a mess, somebody calls me. Always somebody calls me.
effect: EndConversation

name: Working
npc: (He doesn't look up from the floor.)
+ The new doc wants this place spotless before he sees patients. Mind your feet.
effect: EndConversation
